{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"当前最值得解释的不是单纯的增强，而是：已经较清楚地表达过的感受，此刻没有继续保持成一条稳定的直线，而是变得断续、反复聚集，像是在一次次重新取得表达的连续性；到段末仍处于蓄起而未真正安定的状态。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H1：此前这份感受曾从未明确表达进入较清楚的表达，但短暂增强之后并没有一直维持在高强度。\",\"bridge\":\"因为此前的清楚表达和增强都没有稳定持续，这一次不必被理解成第一次鼓起感受，而更像是那次表达之后仍未平稳下来的余续：原本已经能说清的东西，现在只能以一阵阵集中、松开、再集中的方式继续存在。\",\"current\":\"因此本段快速音群、短促和弦型与较厚落点之间的反复转换，可以对应一种难以连续维持的表达状态；最后持续音、颤音与渐强使这种感受重新聚拢起来，但这里只能确认它正在积聚，不能据此认为已有新的决定、回应或解决。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H1，本段更容易只被理解为一次独立的活跃或蓄势；有了此前“已经表达清楚却未能持续”的事实，当前这种断续而反复聚集的形态才具有明确来处。\"},\"used\":[\"H1\"],\"new_history\":[\"较清楚地表达过之后，这份感受并没有就此稳定下来；当连续表达维持不住时，它会转成断续、反复重新聚集的状态。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"解释依赖H1中“清楚表达和增强未能持续”这一具体经历；没有把渐强或主题结构解释成外部回应，也没有额外制造决定、领悟或关系进展。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2d823305-060b-4043-83c8-6ddefeb41a1f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214259396130Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.984, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:43:22.388971+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ffb660d2355b8d59204ed3104dcf45babb5e34ffa92970ab1b68da58dd38f283", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214259396130Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "60b4e9807dc8f0de2da571adc503a7369392dc098812b23fb117ed4d88318826"}}}
